            </summary>
            <div class="p-4 text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
              Most Massachusetts state forest and reservation trailheads are free or low-cost.
              Mount Greylock State Reservation charges a seasonal parking fee at its main lots,
              and some Connecticut state parks near the Litchfield Hills cluster require a
              day-use fee in season. Check each trail's parking information page for specifics.
            </div>
